[ti:Sel kan i dderz]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Au Nom de Tous Les Miens]
[length:4:06]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:15.40] Sel-kan i dderz n tewser
[00:18.17] Ad d-ittaẓ yečča-d tawwurt
[00:23.49] Ddunit-ik yeǧǧa-tt liser
[00:26.34] Ḥetteten-ak wiyyad tarbut
[00:31.91] Ulayɣer teseḍlameḍ zzman
[00:34.67] I ik-d-igran d cfayat kan
[00:37.07] Qeleb yef ṣṣbeṛ ik-yeǧǧan
[00:42.39] Wamagin temẓi-k tfut
